[{"id":185199441,"discussion_id":"62e6b62f1be15b2bf67debb1ad81a8bceb51016e","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本 PR 修复了 `MxFP8` 量化 Flash Attention 在 `USE_DN` 场景下 prefill 最小值初始化的不一致问题：`quant_flash_attn_block_vec_mxfp8.h` 中删除了 `minValue_` 的一处额外赋值，使标量路径不再提前用 `NEGATIVE_MIN_VALUE_FP32` 覆盖 `minValue_`，从而与 VF 路径保持一致的初始化，避免乘完 scale 后产生数值误差导致行无效判断失败。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **删除 `USE_DN` 分支中的 `minValue_` 重复初始化**: 在 `if constexpr (USE_DN)` 块内删除了 `minValue_ = NEGATIVE_MIN_VALUE_FP32;` 这一行，使后续 `UpdateMinCheckValue()` 使用与 VF 路径一致的初始化值，修复标量与向量路径下 prefill 最小值不一致导致的数值误差。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-17T20:58:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-17T21:01:32+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":185199477,"discussion_id":"04fa6cb1f66367cd9138cf4f6fda2f4db62820c6","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC).\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml).\nFor more, you also can visit [**HICANN**](https://digital.hicann.cn/#/access_control_detail?repository=ops-transformer&pr_number=10184&branch=master&pipelineType=pipeline).\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*shen_weiling*](https://gitcode.com/sh